Z||000003||stsmithgt||07-11-2001||05:36 PM||||It probably wouldn't be too expensive to cover the center console with your desired color.  I thought of adding a jell like cushion similar to wrist rests they have for computors.  That would feel much better on the arm and elbow than that hard vinyl center console.  Even a sealed cell foam form fitted would be fairly cheap and effective.  When I <u><B>had</u></B> sheepskin seat covers, I put a piece of fur over the center and that was nice, but get sheepskin wet and it smells like a wet dog.  The smell stuck to my clothes too. yuk!  <BR>Well, there's my 2 cents on the center console.  Remember, it's not bad to think outside of the box. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>My work of art.(in progress.)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
